<title>UK: S&amp;P says may upgrade Tyco Toys ratings.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P says may upgrade Tyco Toys ratings.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Tuesday it had placed Tyco Toys Inc's B plus corporate credit rating, and B minus subordinated debt and preferred stock ratings on CreditWatch with positive implications.</p>
<p>The rating agency said the move followed Mattel's proposal to acquire Tyco for about $755 million in Mattel common stock.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 6137</p>
